(29067,42,0,'There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Silvermoon. This world is worth saving.',12,0,100,0,0,0,29376,0,'special_surprise SAY_EXEC_TIME_1'),
