(33642,0,0,'Here I have amassed what may well be the greatest depository of lore in all of Outland. Even the grand libraries of Silvermoon City pale in comparison. Please... look, read, browse to your heart\'s content. You\'ll find everything organized and clearly labeled.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
