(38455,1,0,'You ready to make their leader surrender, $g buddy : lady;? Okay, here we go.',12,0,100,1,0,0,38357,0,'Ace to Player'),
(38455,2,0,'We\'ve got your hatchlings. You better not attack us if you know what\'s good for you!',14,0,100,5,0,0,38375,0,'Ace'),
(38455,3,0,'We know you were getting ready to attack us. You brought this on yourselves.',14,0,100,5,0,3434,38377,0,'Ace'),
(38455,4,0,'You naga keep your distance. We\'re not kidding around here!',14,0,100,5,0,3434,38374,0,'Ace'),
(38455,5,0,'Alright, naga leader, come on out from hiding and surrender in the name of $n and the Bilgewater Cartel!',14,0,100,5,0,0,38381,0,'Ace to Player'),
(38455,6,0,'Um, dude, this does not look good. I\'m out of here!',12,0,100,5,0,0,38358,0,'Ace to Faceless of the Deep'),
(38469,0,0,'Enough!',14,0,100,0,0,19606,0,0,'Lady Sylvanas Windrunner'),
(38469,1,0,'Let\'s see how brave Gilneas gets on without its stubborn leader!',14,0,100,0,0,19606,0,0,'Lady Sylvanas Windrunner'),
(38469,2,0,'Such a waste.  That arrow\'s poison was not meant to be wasted on your whelp.  We\'ll meet again, Genn!',12,0,100,0,0,19606,0,0,'Lady Sylvanas Windrunner to Prince Liam Greymane'),
(38469,4,0,'Dann wollen wir doch mal sehen, wie tapfer Gilneas ohne seinen störrischen Anführer ist!',14,0,100,0,0,0,38368,0,'Fürstin Sylvanas Windläufer'),
(38470,0,0,'Block their retreat, Liam!  We\'ve got them right where we want them!',14,0,100,0,0,19606,0,0,'King Genn Greymane to Player'),
