(42465,0,0,'They seek only power, as the Twilight do.  Yet you are confident that they will not turn on us.  Did I raise you to be fools?',12,0,100,1,0,21105,0,0,'Therazane'),
(42465,1,0,'They slaughtered stone troggs, Gorik?  This is supposed to sway me?  It is not much of a feat.',12,0,100,1,0,21106,0,0,'Therazane to Therazane'),
(42465,2,0,'What of you Boden?  What do you see in this \"champion?\"',12,0,100,1,0,21107,0,0,'Therazane to Therazane'),
(42465,3,0,'That very well may be.  Even fools have uses though.  I keep you around after all.',12,0,100,1,0,21108,0,0,'Therazane to Therazane'),
(42465,4,0,'And so the \"champion\" arrives.',12,0,100,1,0,21093,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),
(42465,5,0,'So small.  So soft.  It\'s a wonder you\'ve even lasted this long down here, fleshling.',12,0,100,1,0,21094,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),
(42465,6,0,'Or perhaps a testament to your abilities?',12,0,100,1,0,21095,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),
(42465,7,0,'All of this for a piece of the World Pillar?  What exactly, shaman, do you intend to do with it?',12,0,100,1,0,21096,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),
(42465,8,0,'And what then? Will you leave Deepholm to its denizens?',12,0,100,1,0,21097,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),
(42465,9,0,'I\'m glad you\'re at least that perceptive.',12,0,100,1,0,21098,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),
(42465,10,0,'I propose this: We will march on the Twilight cult and extinguish any utterings of Deathwing\'s name from this realm.  Your Earthen Ring will march with us.',12,0,100,1,0,21099,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),
(42465,11,0,'You do this, and I will send Gorsik to the temple with our piece of the World Pillar.',12,0,100,1,0,21100,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),
(42465,12,0,'Seal the rift and leave this place.',12,0,100,1,0,21101,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),
(42465,13,0,'Save your thanks.  We march upon the Twilight Precipice as soon as our forces are gathered. I expect to see you on the battlefield.',12,0,100,1,0,21102,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),
(42466,0,0,'Speak with Terrath the Steady when you are ready to begin.',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Terrath the Steady to Player'),
(42466,1,0,'Be swift, $c. The stone dragons will not give up easily.',12,0,100,1,0,21647,0,0,'Terrath the Steady to Player'),
(42466,2,0,'You\'ve strayed too far from the Stonemother\'s gaze, dragon.  It is time that you be put in your place.',14,0,100,1,0,21649,0,0,'Terrath the Steady to Player'),
(42466,3,0,'Jump from rock to rock to attract the attention of the Broodmother!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Terrath the Steady to Player'),
(42466,4,0,'She submits.  Well done, fleshling.',14,0,100,1,0,21650,0,0,'Terrath the Steady to Aeosera'),
