(43792,0,0,'You\'ve proven true to your word, Earthmender.  For that, we will spare you our wrath.  ',12,0,100,1,0,21078,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),
(43792,1,0,'Once your wounded are gathered, you can thank me by leaving.',12,0,100,1,0,21079,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),
(43797,3,3,'No... NO! STOP IT!',14,0,100,15,0,0,43980,0,'Tobias Mistmantle to Player'),
(43797,4,4,'No...',12,0,100,0,0,0,43982,0,'Tobias Mistmantle to Stalvan Mistmantle'),
(43802,0,0,'Is this the one you are wasting your time with, Diamant?',12,0,100,1,0,21087,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),
(43802,1,0,'Then you take responsibility for its actions, Stone Lord.  You will be the one answering to me when it shows its true intent.',12,0,100,1,0,21088,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),
(43802,2,0,'And you fleshling, consider for a moment that you are entirely surrounded by rock in this place.  The very earth you walk on bends to my will.',12,0,100,1,0,21089,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),
(43802,3,0,'If you betray us, there will be no escape for you.  I will crush your body so slowly that you shall hear every single one of your bones break.',12,0,100,1,0,21090,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),
(43802,4,0,'I\'m glad we had this talk.',12,0,100,1,0,21091,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),
(43807,0,0,'You know where I stand, Stonemother.',12,0,100,0,0,21764,0,0,'Diamant the Patient to Therazane'),
(43807,1,0,'This champion has proved intent and capable.',12,0,100,0,0,21765,0,0,'Diamant the Patient to Therazane'),
(43807,2,0,'I see no reason to deny our trust.',12,0,100,0,0,21766,0,0,'Diamant the Patient to Therazane'),
