(43984,2,0,'Kill nearest mystic.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Reactivated War Construct to Player'),
(44024,0,0,'Step on through, $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Artesh to Player'),
(44058,0,0,'Whew, that was a bit of a tight squeeze, but the rest of the trip should be a breeze.',12,0,100,0,0,0,44386,0,''),
(44058,1,0,'There`s nothing quite like the smell of Durotar on a warm, comfortable boat ride.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,''),
(44058,2,0,'This is where you`d expect something to go wrong on a beautiful trip like this.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,''),
(44058,3,0,'Everyone always says, Horton, why do you drive a boat up and down the river? I ask them, Why don`t you? ... that`s usually where I run out of witty retorts.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,''),
(44058,4,0,'We`re pulling up near your stop. Head due west along the road to reach Nozzlepot`s Outpost.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,''),
(44083,3,0,'Привет, $n!',15,0,100,0,0,18276,62261,0,'Линзи Зарубай to Player'),
(44086,0,0,'The... They promised that we would have security...',12,0,33,0,0,0,0,0,'Panicked Citizen Random Saying'),
(44086,1,1,'It means we go from here! The screams are stronger every night.',12,0,33,0,0,0,0,0,'Panicked Citizen Random Saying'),
