(45417,5,0,'Here we are!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Fiona'),
(45429,0,0,'Shotgun!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar Sunstrike '),
(45429,1,0,'Because I won our bet. And I called shotgun.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar Sunstrike '),
(45429,2,0,'Fine. I killed five zombies. And they were huge. How many undead did you kill?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar Sunstrike '),
(45429,3,0,'I\'m going to bet that you only killed four.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar Sunstrike '),
(45429,4,0,'I didn\'t. You just told me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar Sunstrike '),
(45429,5,0,'So seriously, how did your undead hunting go? I want to hear stories.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar Sunstrike '),
(45429,6,0,'Gidwin? Are you ignoring me?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar Sunstrike '),
(45429,7,0,'Giddy... you are mad at me, aren\'t you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar Sunstrike '),
(45429,8,0,'Remember when we were kids, Gidwin? We would spend all day pretending to fight the trolls, or the murlocs, or the girls.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar Sunstrike '),
(45429,9,0,'We had a name we called ourselves... what was it?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar Sunstrike '),
(45429,10,0,'I\'m dead serious. I\'ve completely forgotten.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar Sunstrike '),
(45429,11,0,'Actually, I agree with Fiona.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar Sunstrike '),
(45429,12,0,' The Argent Crusade can wait for us a little while longer. Besides, our guest may want to get off the caravan soon.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar Sunstrike '),
(45431,0,0,'Hey now! Why do you get to sit in front?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Gidwin Goldbraids '),
(45431,1,0,'Who says you won the bet? We haven\'t compared tallies yet.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Gidwin Goldbraids '),
(45431,2,0,'I\'m pretty sure I killed six.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Gidwin Goldbraids '),
(45431,3,0,'H... how did you know that?',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,0,'Gidwin Goldbraids '),
(45431,4,0,'Don\'t do this, Tarenar.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Gidwin Goldbraids '),
(45431,5,0,'You remember damn well enough what it was.',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,0,'Gidwin Goldbraids '),
(45431,6,0,' <Sigh>... \"The Paladin Pals\".',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Gidwin Goldbraids '),
(45431,7,0,'Maybe now I don\'t want to. Maybe I like it better sitting back here with my new friend. It smells like horses up there.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Gidwin Goldbraids '),
(45431,8,0,'We just rested a few minutes ago! Let\'s just go to Light\'s Hope Chapel!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Gidwin Goldbraids '),
(45431,9,0,'We won\'t lose a horse. Look at them! They look exactly like they did when we started.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Gidwin Goldbraids '),
