(48487,0,0,'What is going on in here?!',12,0,100,5,0,0,48691,0,'Whisperwind Druid to Player'),
(48487,1,0,'The Arch Druid... how in the world...?',12,0,100,274,0,0,48692,0,'Whisperwind Druid to Player'),
(48487,2,0,'I... I must tell the others. You should find Huntress Selura right away.',12,0,100,1,0,0,48693,0,'Whisperwind Druid to Player'),
(48494,0,0,'Prepare the Micro Mechachicken!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48494,1,0,'There\'s a great deal that you do not understand, my dear Greely. That is why you are the assistant and I... I am Hobart Grapplehammer!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48494,2,0,'Excellent. Now back away from the Ultra Concave Fissionable Testing Platform. Slowly, if you please.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48494,3,0,'Thank you. Now behold as I stabilize the highly unstable miniaturization process.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48494,4,0,'I am going to end the horrible problem of food storage cutting into the profits of the Bilgewater Cartel!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48494,5,0,'I\'ll soon be revered as the greatest goblin tinker of all times! Besides, that negligence case involving the creation of the gilgoblins will never stick.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48494,6,0,'Flip the switch!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48494,7,0,'Quite right, Greely. You passed today\'s pop quiz.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48494,8,0,'I am now flipping the switch!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48494,9,0,'Greely, can you feel it? My moment of success is at hand!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48494,10,0,'Grocery store owners everywhere will owe me a percentage of their profits!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48494,11,0,'I\'m flipping the second switch!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48494,12,0,'The micro mechachicken begins to grow and Greely starts sneaking away from the machine.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48494,13,0,'Wait... something\'s wrong!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48494,14,0,'I know... I know! Where\'s the override? The override?!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48494,15,0,'Here goes nothing, I always loved you, Greely!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48494,16,0,'Flipping the override switch now!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48494,17,0,'The micro mechachicken quickly shrinks back to normal.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48494,18,0,'Are we still alive?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48494,19,0,'Well of course we are, my dear Greely. And look there. The Micro Mechachicken\'s stabilization appears to be a complete success!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48494,20,0,'The micro mechachicken explodes.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48494,21,0,'I haven\'t the foggiest notion what you\'re talking about, Miss Greely.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48496,0,0,'You don\'t have to yell, Hobart, I\'m standing right here. Sheesh!',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48496,1,0,'There. One Micro Mechachicken. I\'ll never understand how you come up with these names.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48496,2,0,'Greely sighs and rolls her eyes.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48496,3,0,'Yes, Doctor Grapplehammer.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48496,4,0,'The assistant shakes her head.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48496,5,0,'Greely coughs.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48496,6,0,'Um, Hobart, you\'re at the controls.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48496,7,0,'Ya think? Hobart, the Micro Mechachicken is destabilizing. It\'s expanding!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48496,8,0,'It\'s the one on the far right! Hurry, Hobart! It\'s going to eggsplode!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48496,9,0,'WHAT?!!!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48496,10,0,'We\'re still alive, Doctor Grapplehammer, despite your best efforts.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48496,11,0,'Is that egg on your face?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48496,12,0,'Hobart\'s jaw hits the ground.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48496,13,0,'Now what\'s this about you \'always loved me\', Grapplehammer?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
(48496,14,0,'We can both agree on that, doctor.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),
