(49234,1,0,'Uulwi gag erh\'ongg w\'ssh.',14,0,100,53,0,14046,0,0,'The Beast Unleashed'),
(49252,0,0,'Oh, like you coulda done any better.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,'Fargo Flintlocke to Player'),
(49253,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),
(49255,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),
(49275,0,0,'Get it! Kill it!',12,0,100,5,0,14046,0,0,'Keely Dunwald'),
(49277,0,0,'It\'s one of them!',12,0,100,0,0,14046,0,0,'Iain Firebeard'),
(49278,0,0,'Stop that thing!',12,0,100,0,0,14046,0,0,'Cliff Thundermar'),
(49279,0,0,'For the Wildhammer!',14,0,100,0,0,14046,0,0,'Russell Brower to The Beast Unleashed'),
(49314,0,0,'Waaaaahhhhh!!',12,0,100,0,0,14046,0,0,'Donnelly Dunwald'),
(49337,0,0,'Hello again.',12,0,100,3,0,0,49455,0,'Darnell'),
(49337,1,0,'I know the way to Deathknell. Come with me!',12,0,100,273,0,0,49456,0,'Darnell'),
(49337,2,0,'Good, you\'re still here. Now, where\'s Deathguard Saltain?',12,0,100,1,0,0,49457,0,'Darnell'),
(49337,3,0,'Ah, here he is.',12,0,100,1,0,0,49458,0,'Darnell'),
(49337,4,0,'Let\'s get moving, $n. Saltain said that we\'d fine some corpses up here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,49459,0,'Darnell'),
(49337,5,0,'I think I see some corpses up ahead. Let\'s go, $n! You do the searching and fighting. I\'ll do the lifting.',12,0,100,0,0,0,49460,0,'Darnell'),
(49361,0,0,'You\'re okay, Firebeard. *urp* You\'re okay by me.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,'Colin Thundermar'),
(49363,0,0,'Twilight\'s Hammer don\'t scare me none. Bring \'em on!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,'Keely Dunwald'),
(49364,0,0,'BEST! WEDDING! EVAR! *Hic*',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,'Eoin Dunwald'),
(49422,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Enrage'),
(49423,0,0,'I\'ll kill you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,82415,0,''),
(49423,0,1,'Look what they\'ve done to me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,50325,0,''),
(49423,0,2,'Who am I?',12,0,100,0,0,0,50320,0,''),
(49423,0,3,'You will die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,''),
(49424,0,0,'BLEEAAAGGHHH! I\'m a monster, don\'t look at me!',14,0,100,0,0,0,50326,0,''),
(49426,0,0,'Hi, $N! What do you think about my new gear?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,''),
(49426,1,0,'They\'re making me into a Deathguard. Can you believe it?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,''),
(49426,2,0,'I\'ll probably be staying here in Deathknell. If things work out, though... who knows? Maybe I\'ll get to meet the Dark Lady herself.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,''),
(49426,3,0,'How about you? I\'ve heard that Sarvis is going to send you off to Calston Estate. Big assignment, eh?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,''),
(49426,4,0,'Well, I won\'t hold you up. It\'s been a pleasure, $N. I hope our paths cross again soon.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,''),
(49427,0,0,'I found this amazing creature in the lava under this room. Magmar will be a worthy adversary for your little squad.',14,0,100,0,0,23367,49060,0,'Нефариан to Магмарь'),
(49427,1,0,'Непостижимо! Вы, кажется, можете уничтожить моего лавового червяка! Пожалуй, я помогу ему.',14,0,100,0,0,23368,49782,0,'Нефариан to Магмарь'),
(49427,2,0,'Вы победили? Вот... незадача. А мне было приятно смотреть, как вы жаритесь в огне.',14,0,100,0,0,23366,49062,0,'Нефариан to Магмарь'),
(49429,0,0,'Poor Glubtok. When his powers manifested, his own ogre mound was the first to burn.',12,0,100,0,0,24602,49715,0,'Vanessa VanCleef glubtok 1'),
(49429,1,0,'Deep within his soul, the one thing he feared most of all was...himself.',12,0,100,0,0,24603,49716,0,'Vanessa VanCleef glubtok 2'),
(49429,2,0,'Most rogues prefer to cloak themselves in the shadows, but not Helix.',12,0,100,0,0,24604,49723,0,'Vanessa VanCleef helix 1'),
(49429,3,0,'You never know what skitters in the darkness.',12,0,100,0,0,24605,49724,0,'Vanessa VanCleef helix 2'),
(49429,4,0,'Can you imagine the life of a machine?',12,0,100,0,0,24606,49725,0,'Vanessa VanCleef foereaper 1'),
(49429,5,0,'A simple spark can mean the difference between life...and death.',12,0,100,0,0,24607,49726,0,'Vanessa VanCleef foereaper 2'),
(49429,6,0,'Ripsnarl wasn\'\'t always a bloodthirsty savage. Once, he even had a family.',12,0,100,0,0,24608,49742,0,'Vanessa VanCleef admiral 1'),
(49429,7,0,'He was called James Harrington. A tragedy in three parts.',12,0,100,0,0,24609,49745,0,'Vanessa VanCleef admiral 2'),
(49429,8,0,'I\'ve been waiting a long time for this, you know.',12,0,100,0,0,24613,49477,0,'Vanessa VanCleef intro 1'),
(49429,9,0,'Biding my time, building my forces, studying the minds of my enemies.',12,0,100,0,0,24614,49478,0,'Vanessa VanCleef intro 2'),
(49429,10,0,'I was never very good at hand-to-hand combat, you know. Not like my father.',12,0,100,0,0,24615,49479,0,'Vanessa VanCleef intro 3'),
(49429,11,0,'But I always excelled at poisons.',12,0,100,0,0,24616,49480,0,'Vanessa VanCleef intro 4'),
(49429,12,0,'Especially venoms that affect the mind.',12,0,100,0,0,24617,49481,0,'Vanessa VanCleef intro 5'),
(49448,3,0,'Голдринн! Стало быть, это правда... Древние боги снова среди нас!',12,0,100,66,0,0,49557,0,'Командир Джерод Песнь Теней to Player'),
(49450,3,0,'У вас не так много времени. Вражеское подкрепление уже в пути.',12,0,100,0,0,0,49556,0,'Голдринн to Player'),
(49452,3,0,'Оставим празднование на потом, командир. Сумеречные драконы приближаются!',12,0,100,0,0,0,49560,0,'Авиана to Player'),
(49476,0,0,'RAZ, NOOOOOOOOOOO!!!!',14,0,100,0,0,0,49597,0,'Finkle Einhorn'),
(49477,0,0,'I fear time may not be on our side, Ilthalaine. The battle may carry to Teldrassil itself if we do not act soon.',12,0,100,0,0,0,49682,0,'Huntress Sandrya Moonfall'),
(49478,0,0,'We will leave you to your training, Ilthalaine. This is your area of expertise.',12,0,100,0,0,0,49683,0,'Dentaria Silverglade'),
(49478,1,0,'Study well, $n. We may need you fighting by our side before the next moon fills.',12,0,100,0,0,0,49684,0,'Dentaria Silverglade'),
(49479,0,0,'Iverron\'s poison is cured, but it will take some time for him to recover.',12,0,100,0,0,0,49668,0,'Dentaria Silverglade'),
(49479,1,0,'Shadowthread Cave lies to the north. Be careful, it\'s dangerous there of late.',12,0,100,0,0,0,49665,0,'Dentaria Silverglade'),
(49479,2,0,'The moonwell is to the northeast, on the other side of the pool and up the hill.',12,0,100,0,0,0,49666,0,'Dentaria Silverglade'),
(49479,3,0,'The ramp up to Aldrassil is just in sight over there. Circle around and find Tenaron up top.',12,0,100,0,0,0,49667,0,'Dentaria Silverglade'),
(49480,0,0,'You\'ve come to help, $c? Let us stay together for a while.',12,0,100,0,0,0,49550,0,'Tarindrella'),
(49480,1,0,'The corruption goes much further than these spiders. I fear the true source is not within this cave.',12,0,100,0,0,0,49673,0,'Tarindrella'),
