(56184,1,0,'Отдавай все овощи!',12,0,100,15,0,0,54873,0,'Косозуб-вредитель to Player'),
(56184,3,0,'А-А-АЙ!',12,0,100,53,0,0,103761,0,'Косозуб-вредитель to Player'),
(56184,4,0,'%s is trying to escape in a panic!',16,0,100,53,0,0,1150,0,'Косозуб-вредитель'),
(56185,3,0,'У нас лучше овощи! Ваши хуже!',12,0,100,0,0,0,66821,0,'Косозуб-трудяга to Player'),
(56185,4,0,'%s is trying to escape in a panic!',16,0,100,0,0,0,1150,0,'Косозуб-трудяга'),
(56194,3,0,'%s убегает!',16,0,100,0,0,0,89989,0,'Паучонок'),
(56204,0,0,'Greetings, Chen, Li Li. You may stay, but I do need any of your ale.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,''),
(56206,0,0,'You would champion the cause of such a lowly street rat? Very well, best me in combat and I shall consider giving you my blessing.',12,0,100,1,0,0,54781,0,'EvStartText text'),
(56206,1,0,'Enough! You win... champion. Tell that upstart that he has my blessing.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'EvEndText text'),
(56208,3,0,'Не трогай моих овец!',14,0,100,0,0,3580,55079,0,'Пастух Франсис to Волк-налетчик'),
(56209,0,0,' At last! A challenge! Let us test your mettle, \"champion\".',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'EvStartText text'),
(56209,1,0,' That was a fine battle! The likes of which I have not enjoyed in many decades. Go and give the boy my blessing.',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'EvEndText text'),
(56210,0,0,'A Wanderbrew wants to marry an Goldendraft?! Preposterous.',12,0,100,1,0,0,54788,0,'EvStartText text'),
(56210,1,0,'I yield! The boy chose his champion well. Give him my blessing and make sure he does not squander it.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'EvEndText text'),
(56236,0,0,'I... I am in your debt.',12,0,100,0,0,0,55139,0,'Injured Sailor to Player'),
(56236,0,1,'I\'m... alive?  Thank you... thank you so much!',12,0,100,18,0,0,63840,0,'Injured Sailor to Player'),
(56236,0,2,'I can... I can barely breathe.  I\'m alive thanks to you.',12,0,100,18,0,0,64337,0,'Injured Sailor to Player'),
(56236,0,3,'I\'m alive thanks only to you... I won\'t forget this.',12,0,100,18,0,0,64342,0,'Injured Sailor to Player'),
(56236,0,4,'I thought that was it... I thought I was going to die.  Thank you, stranger.',12,0,100,18,0,0,64344,0,'Injured Sailor to Player'),
(56236,0,5,'I owe you my life.',12,0,100,2,0,0,64348,0,'Injured Sailor to Player'),
(56236,0,6,'Thank you for the timely rescue, hero.',12,0,100,2,0,0,64355,0,'Injured Sailor to Player'),
(56236,3,0,'I ... I owe you one.',12,0,100,0,0,0,55139,0,'Раненый матрос to Player'),
(56248,1,0,'Вас разыскивают Очи Перот\'арна.',41,0,100,0,0,0,55984,0,'Hunting Summon Stalker to Перот\'арн'),
(56267,3,0,'Похоже, увиденное укрепило твою решимость. Значит, я сделал все, что было в моих силах.',12,0,100,4,0,30062,64690,0,'Хранитель истории Чо to Player'),
(56268,3,0,'Искра должна находиться в центре!',42,0,100,0,0,30055,64687,0,'Медитирующий to Player'),
(56269,3,0,'А как насчет... ЭТОГО?!',12,0,100,274,0,30059,64130,0,'Хранитель истории Чо to Хранитель истории Чо'),
(56310,0,0,'Ты... не уйдешь!',14,0,100,0,0,0,55203,0,'Туманный ужас to Player'),
(56312,0,0,'Хорошо вам провести время у Грязной Кружки! И спасибо еще раз!',14,0,100,2,0,31200,55372,0,'Шан Громовая Пята to Player'),
(56333,1,0,'Let\'s move out, friend! There\'s no time to lose.',12,0,100,3,0,0,54902,0,'say'),
(56333,2,0,'Corastrasza is understandably upset. Under her care was the one black dragon egg that we believe was free of the taint of Deathwing\'s corruption...',12,0,100,3,0,0,54903,0,'say'),
(56333,3,0,'...and it was stolen away from us by thieves in the night!',12,0,100,3,0,0,54904,0,'say'),
(56333,4,0,'You\'ve found for us our only lead. The rogues from Ravenholdt are behind this.',12,0,100,3,0,0,54905,0,'say'),
(56333,5,0,'Ravenholdt? It just doesn\'t make sense! A mongrel band of petty thieves. How did they even KNOW about the egg?',12,0,100,3,0,0,54906,0,'say'),
(56333,6,0,'We\'ll get to the bottom of this. Someone with your skills is exactly what we need.',12,0,100,3,0,0,54907,0,'say'),
(56333,7,0,'What\'s the expression? \"To catch a thief,\" they say?',12,0,100,3,0,0,54908,0,'say'),
(56333,8,0,'Look at this devastation. These foothills have never recovered from the campaigns of the second and third wars.',12,0,100,3,0,0,54909,0,'say'),
(56333,9,0,'Ruins and debris litter the landscape... and I consider the thieves and assassins of Ravenholdt to be part of that debris.',12,0,100,3,0,0,54910,0,'say'),
(56333,10,0,'Without a state... without a cause... what drives them, do you wonder?',12,0,100,3,0,0,54911,0,'say'),
(56333,11,0,'And what possessed them to strike out against the red dragonflight? Madness. We must learn more!',12,0,100,3,0,0,54912,0,'say'),
(56333,12,0,'We\'re almost to Ravenholdt Manor.',12,0,100,3,0,0,54913,0,'say'),
(56333,13,0,'If they have the egg, it\'s too dangerous to risk an all-out assault. You\'ll need to sneak in there, find out what they\'re up to... And retrieve the egg at any cost.',12,0,100,3,0,0,54914,0,'say'),
(56333,14,0,'Quiet now! We\'ll form up a plan within this cave...',12,0,100,3,0,0,54915,0,'say'),
(56343,0,0,'I am called Chen, and this is my niece, Li Li.',12,0,100,0,0,0,57066,0,''),
(56343,1,0,'May we stay at your farmhouse for a while? We do not have much in the way of money, but I will gladly share some of my famous ale with you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,''),
(56343,2,0,'Thank you! We will not trouble you for long.',12,0,100,0,0,0,57069,0,''),
(56344,0,0,'Ну наконец-то!',12,0,100,5,0,30373,57065,0,'Ли Ли to Player'),
(56344,1,0,'Еще одна остановка? Дядя Чэнь, мы же не прошли и десяти метров!',12,0,100,5,0,30374,57071,0,'Ли Ли to Чэнь Буйный Портер'),
(56345,3,0,'Наберитесь терпения, госпожа Манн. Эти чужаки не перестают меня удивлять.',12,0,100,1,0,30091,61071,0,'Хранитель истории Чо to Player'),
(56346,0,0,'Honey-Bear! I mean... it is about time.',12,0,100,0,0,0,61221,0,'Штейгер Манн to Player'),
(56346,1,0,'Don\'t you \"snow lily\" me! I was- WE- were worried sick about you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,61222,0,'Штейгер Манн to Player'),
(56346,2,0,'And the delivery is not for ME, Hao! The honorable Lorewalker has been waitin- oh...',12,0,100,0,0,0,61225,0,'Штейгер Манн to Player'),
(56346,3,0,'Я бы с удовольствием помогла тебе, хранитель истории, но сейчас мне трудно!',12,0,100,0,0,29533,61028,0,'Штейгер Манн to Player'),
(56347,3,0,'Сюда!',12,0,100,0,0,32863,143887,0,'Хао Манн to Player'),
(56348,3,0,'Я буду и дальше искать нефрит. Если хочешь, обойди местных и предложи им свою помощь.',12,0,100,0,0,0,63569,0,'Тоя to Player'),
(56349,3,0,'Мое!',12,0,100,0,0,0,61341,0,'Злобный дух to Злобный дух'),
(56398,1,0,'Thank you. Let us begin.',12,0,100,0,0,0,58129,0,''),
(56398,2,0,'Ancient spirits of water.',12,0,100,0,0,0,55045,0,''),
(56398,3,0,'Hear my echo through the silent deeps.',12,0,100,0,0,0,55046,0,''),
(56398,4,0,'Awaken from the great waters beyond.',12,0,100,0,0,0,55047,0,''),
(56398,5,0,'Aid your children in this time of need!',12,0,100,0,0,0,55048,0,''),
(56398,6,0,'A great darkness? Could he mean that we must trust these strangers... these... Alliance... after all?',12,0,100,0,0,0,55049,0,''),
(56416,0,0,'Thank Shen-zin Su that you\'re here.  I could use your help!',12,0,100,0,0,27384,64848,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Vordraka, the Deep Sea Nightmare'),
(56416,1,0,'Get clear when it when it raises its weapon, it\'s even stronger than it looks.',12,0,100,0,0,27385,64849,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Vordraka, the Deep Sea Nightmare'),
(56416,2,0,'It\'s calling allies!  I\'ll keep him busy while you handle them.',12,0,100,0,0,27386,64850,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Vordraka, the Deep Sea Nightmare'),
(56416,3,0,'We\'re wearing him down.  Keep it up!',12,0,100,0,0,27387,64852,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Vordraka, the Deep Sea Nightmare'),
(56416,4,0,'I don\'t know what I would have done without you.  It\'s good that you came.',12,0,100,0,0,27388,64853,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Vordraka, the Deep Sea Nightmare'),
(56418,0,0,'If we lose the healers, Shen-zin Su dies, and all of us with him!  Keep them safe.',14,0,100,0,0,0,66063,0,'Ji Firepaw'),
(56427,0,0,'You won\'t get near the Master. Dragonriders, attack!',14,0,100,0,0,26210,55443,0,'Warmaster Blackhorn aggro'),
(56427,1,0,'Well...done, heh. But I wonder if you\'re good enough...to best him.',14,0,100,0,0,26211,55444,0,'Warmaster Blackhorn death'),
