(60530,0,0,'Alright, my first fight!',12,0,100,1,0,0,59931,0,'EvStartText text'),
(60532,0,0,'Prepare for the beating of your life, weakling!',12,0,100,0,0,0,59932,0,''),
(60532,1,0,'I am... humbled.',12,0,100,0,0,0,59948,0,''),
(60533,0,0,'Today is the day I defeat my rival!',12,0,100,0,0,0,59933,0,''),
(60533,1,0,'I lost to $n, twice in a row? I can\'t believe it.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,''),
(60534,0,0,'I apologize in advance for the beating you are about to suffer.',12,0,100,0,0,0,59934,0,''),
(60534,1,0,'Very interesting...',12,0,100,0,0,0,107292,0,''),
(60535,0,0,'YAAAAAAAAHHHH!!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,59935,0,''),
(60535,1,0,'Nice moves, sweetie. Maybe I\'ll see you again...',12,0,100,0,0,0,59951,0,''),
(60536,0,0,'Your winning streak ends here, $n. Today, you fall by my spear.',12,0,100,0,0,0,59936,0,''),
(60536,1,0,'My father forsaw this day in the waters. He told me that I would be defeated, but I refused to believe it.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,''),
(60537,0,0,'I will not hold back on you, $n. Please, do me the same favor.',12,0,100,0,0,0,59937,0,''),
(60537,1,0,'It\'s been a while since I lost to a trainee. Thank you for the match.',12,0,100,0,0,0,59953,0,''),
(60538,0,0,'Just give up! It\'s hopeless! You\'ll never beat me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,59938,0,''),
(60538,1,0,'How did... I don\'t... no, no NO! NOT AGAIN!',12,0,100,0,0,0,59954,0,''),
(60539,0,0,'Good idea! Let\'s ookin\' get it on!',12,0,100,0,0,0,59939,0,''),
(60539,1,0,'Tukka-Tuk pretty sad about losing to wimpy $n. Tukka-Tuk gonna go look at horizon and think about life.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,''),
(60540,0,0,'Don\'t rule me out be just cause I\'m a country boy! I got freakish strong arms, you know.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,'EvStartText text'),
(60540,1,0,'Nice moves. You keep reapin\' in those wins like grain, neighbor. I\'ll be rootin\' for you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,59956,0,'EvEndText text'),
(60541,0,0,'<sigh>...Let\'s get this over with.',12,0,100,1,0,0,59941,0,'EvStartText text'),
(60541,1,0,'Now THAT\'S what I was looking for! You\'ve given me a reason to train again.',12,0,100,1,0,0,59957,0,'EvEndText text'),
(60542,0,0,'By the name of Chi-Ji, I smite you down!',12,0,100,0,0,0,59942,0,''),
(60542,1,0,'Impossible...',12,0,100,0,0,0,51720,0,''),
(60543,0,0,'Give me everything you have, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,59943,0,''),
(60543,1,0,'Yes... yes, I believe you will do. I will see you again shortly, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,''),
(60544,0,0,'Ha ha! Don\'t pull any punches!',12,0,100,0,0,0,59944,0,''),
(60544,1,0,'The taste of defeat... so strange and unfamiliar. Thank you for keeping me humble.',12,0,100,0,0,0,59960,0,''),
(60545,0,0,'My hated rival... so glad you came.',12,0,100,0,0,0,59945,0,''),
(60545,1,0,'Still clinging to the tailfeathers of Chi-Ji, and his idiotic notions of \"hope\"?',12,0,100,0,0,0,60039,0,''),
