(62538,1,0,'Wakener, your deeds have earned you the trust of the Klaxxi.',12,0,100,0,0,30312,67848,0,''),
(62538,2,0,'You are to be rewarded. Walk with me.',12,0,100,0,0,30313,67849,0,''),
(62538,3,0,'We mantid are an elder race. The pandaren you associate with - they are but children. They have their role to play.',12,0,100,0,0,30314,67850,0,''),
(62538,4,0,'Each cycle, our young swarm their walls. The pandaren slay the weak. The strong return.',12,0,100,0,0,30315,67851,0,''),
(62538,5,0,'With each generation, we grow ever stronger.',12,0,100,0,0,30316,67852,0,''),
(62538,6,0,'Before your history began, our empire was vast. We shared this world with our sister kingdoms, Ahn\'Qiraj and Azjol-Nerub.',12,0,100,0,0,30317,67853,0,''),
(62538,7,0,'Our Gods were many, and powerful. We mantid worshipped the seven heads of Y\'shaarj.',12,0,100,0,0,30318,67854,0,''),
(62538,8,0,'Great was the Old One, and terrible was His wrath. He consumed hope and begat despair; He inhaled courage and breathed fear.',12,0,100,0,0,30319,67855,0,''),
(62538,9,0,'When the usurpers came - the ones you call \"Titans\" - Y\'shaarj was destroyed.',12,0,100,0,0,30320,67856,0,''),
(62538,10,0,'His last terrible breath has haunted this land ever since, but the shadows he left behind are mere whispers of his former glory.',12,0,100,0,0,30321,67857,0,''),
(62538,11,0,'I tell you now, because you have earned this warning.',12,0,100,0,0,30322,67858,0,''),
(62538,12,0,'Your gods are not our gods, outsider.',12,0,100,0,0,30323,67859,0,''),
(62538,13,0,'If the Old Ones ever return, we mantid will once again stand by their side.',12,0,100,0,0,30324,67860,0,''),
(62538,14,0,'The wisest among you will do the same.',12,0,100,0,0,30325,67861,0,''),
(62541,0,0,'Give in. The more you fight, the more your hatred broils within you.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,''),
(62541,0,1,'Come, lambs... come and face your demise!',14,0,100,0,0,0,62004,0,''),
(62543,0,0,'Сопляки!',14,0,100,0,0,0,64302,0,'Повелитель клинков Та\'як to Player'),
