(74877,0,0,'Why? What is the use of saving them? Only death awaits us all in the end.',12,0,100,6,0,45622,81488,0,'Yrel to Player'),
(74877,1,0,'I will live to protect the righteous, the helpless, and the hopeless. You are a wise teacher, $n.',12,0,100,1,0,45624,81929,0,'Yrel to Player'),
