(83452,3,0,'Leaf me alone!',12,0,100,0,0,0,88751,0,'Malkor to Player'),
(83463,3,0,'You bring this strange gift and helped those in Skettis... yes, I think we can come to an arrangement. The shadows cover much.',12,0,100,0,0,0,84654,0,'Dusk-Seer Irizzar to Player'),
(83465,0,0,'Long ago, a Bloodmane pridelord commanded his hunters to bring him ten thousand arakkoa feathers.',42,0,100,0,0,46032,84994,0,'Narrator Bunny \"The Talon King\" to Player'),
(83465,1,0,'Eager for the glory of battle, the young chieftain had hoped to incite a war with the arakkoa.',42,0,100,0,0,46033,85004,0,'Narrator Bunny \"The Talon King\" to Player'),
(83465,2,0,'But the Talon King came alone, and what ensued was not a war. It was a slaughter.',42,0,100,0,0,46034,84995,0,'Narrator Bunny \"The Talon King\" to Player'),
(83465,3,0,'He moved with grace and power matched only by the wind.',42,0,100,0,0,46035,84997,0,'Narrator Bunny \"The Talon King\" to Player'),
(83465,4,0,'With the sweep of his wings, he cut down even the strongest of the Bloodmane like so many blades of grass.',42,0,100,0,0,46036,84998,0,'Narrator Bunny \"The Talon King\" to Player'),
(83465,5,0,'Their pridelord was fierce, but he was no match for Terokk.',42,0,100,0,0,46037,85000,0,'Narrator Bunny \"The Talon King\" to Player'),
(83465,6,0,'Satisfied that his message was clear, the Talon King left the Bloodmane to pick up the pieces of their broken tribe.',42,0,100,0,0,46038,85002,0,'Narrator Bunny \"The Talon King\" to Player'),
(83465,7,0,'Его крылья рассекали тела сильнейших воинов, словно лезвие — бумагу.',42,0,100,0,0,46036,84998,0,'Narrator Bunny \"The Talon King\" to Player'),
(83465,8,0,'Он двигался стремительно и плавно, как ветер.',42,0,100,0,0,46035,84997,0,'Narrator Bunny \"The Talon King\" to Player'),
(83465,9,0,'Вожак был свиреп, но не выстоял против Терокка.',42,0,100,0,0,46037,85000,0,'Narrator Bunny \"The Talon King\" to Player'),
(83465,10,0,'Король воронов преподал племени Кровавой Гривы урок, в живых осталась лишь жалкая горстка бойцов.',42,0,100,0,0,46038,85002,0,'Narrator Bunny \"The Talon King\" to Player'),
(83476,0,0,'Вот теперь я могу убивать кого хочу и когда захочу! Я буду ждать тебя в кургане огров. Подходи, когда закончишь – зададим им жару!',14,0,100,0,0,0,85013,0,'Бруто to Player'),
(83485,0,0,'My fists and gratitude are yours, stranger. How do you feel about killing an ogre chief before you go?',12,0,100,2,0,0,85031,0,'Pitfighter Vaandaam to Player'),
(83485,1,0,'Спасибо, $gнезнакомец:незнакомка;. Мои кулаки к твоим услугам. Ну что, ты $gготов:готова; убить вождя огров?',12,0,100,2,0,0,85031,0,'Боец Ваандаам to Player'),
(83518,3,0,'...and the children. Who will care for them now?',12,0,100,6,0,0,85255,0,'Karabor Citizen'),
(83538,3,0,'Со мною мощь Железной Орды!',12,0,100,0,0,0,90426,0,'Командир Песни Войны to Player'),
(83542,2,0,'Наверное, это была плохая идея...',12,0,100,0,0,0,88509,0,'Шон Белое Море to Player'),
(83550,3,0,'...и детки. Кто теперь о них позаботится?',12,0,100,274,0,0,85255,0,'Караборский боевой жрец'),
(83557,0,0,'The Talon King\'s own sages betrayed him. Terokk and his allies were cast into the pools.',42,0,100,0,0,46039,85069,0,'Narrator Bunny \"Terokk\'s Fall\" to Player'),
(83557,1,0,'The accursed blood seared his flesh and tore at his mind.',42,0,100,0,0,46040,85070,0,'Narrator Bunny \"Terokk\'s Fall\" to Player'),
(83557,2,0,'As he withered, Terokk had but one concern: his daughter Lithic.',42,0,100,0,0,46041,85071,0,'Narrator Bunny \"Terokk\'s Fall\" to Player'),
(83557,3,0,'Seeing her broken body, Terokk despaired. He surrendered to the creeping darkness.',42,0,100,0,0,46042,85072,0,'Narrator Bunny \"Terokk\'s Fall\" to Player'),
(83557,4,0,'But in that darkness, something found him.',42,0,100,0,0,46043,85073,0,'Narrator Bunny \"Terokk\'s Fall\" to Player'),
(83557,5,0,'A strange power filled the Talon King. A presence urged him on.',42,0,100,0,0,46044,85074,0,'Narrator Bunny \"Terokk\'s Fall\" to Player'),
(83557,12,0,'The strongest of his guards clung to sanity. And when the Talon King called, they answered.',42,0,100,0,0,46046,85177,0,'Narrator Bunny \"Terokk\'s Fall\" to Player'),
(83557,13,0,'Wretches driven mad by the curse thrashed about in the pools in agony. But Terokk set them free.',42,0,100,0,0,46045,85113,0,'Narrator Bunny \"Terokk\'s Fall\" to Player'),
(83557,14,0,'A strange orb peeked out from the wastes. Gazing into it, Terokk met the being that had saved him.',42,0,100,0,0,46047,85076,0,'Narrator Bunny \"Terokk\'s Fall\" to Player'),
(83557,15,0,'The Raven God Anzu gifted Terokk and his guards with dark powers. In time, they would be known as Talonpriests.',42,0,100,0,0,46048,85079,0,'Narrator Bunny \"Terokk\'s Fall\" to Player'),
(83557,16,0,'Together they would build Skettis, and protect the unwanted children of Rukhmar.',42,0,100,0,0,46049,85186,0,'Narrator Bunny \"Terokk\'s Fall\" to Player'),
(83567,0,0,'Our ancestors will tell great tales of your deeds, commander.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,0,'Firn Swiftbreeze to Player'),
(83567,1,0,'Доставлю куда угодно, командир. Ты только скажи.',12,0,100,2,0,0,85609,0,'Фирн Быстрый Ветер to Player'),
(83567,2,0,'Предки гордились бы тобой, командир.',12,0,100,2,0,0,85608,0,'Фирн Быстрый Ветер to Player'),
(83569,0,0,'Is this one of yours?',12,0,100,0,0,46556,85080,0,'Rexxar to Player'),
(83575,0,0,'Столько мускулов – а камни ломать не можешь? Бестолковый огрон!',14,0,100,0,0,0,90306,0,'Забивальщик'),
(83577,4,0,'Быстро за работу, ленивый огрон!',12,0,100,0,0,0,90312,0,'Заклинатель Земледрог to Player'),
(83578,0,0,'CRUSH THEM!!!',14,0,100,480,0,0,85904,0,'Ogron Laborer to Player'),
(83578,1,0,'ДАВИ ИХ!',14,0,100,480,0,0,100106,0,'Огрон-работник to Player'),
