(100652,0,0,'A well-earned victory! We must, however, stay vigilant. Deep inside the Nightmare Xavius remains, unvanquished. The enemy you fought here was merely his shadow.',12,0,100,0,0,54496,102808,0,'Малфурион Ярость Бури to Тень Ксавия'),
