(102410,0,0,'Citizens of Jandvik! Gather round the fire and hear the glorious news!',14,0,100,1,0,0,105614,0,'Toryl to Player'),
(102410,1,0,'We have lost much at the hands of the Sashj\'tar. Calder, Eynar, and Jarl Throndyr have all fallen to their treachery.',14,0,100,1,0,0,105618,0,'Toryl to Player'),
(102410,2,0,'Hail the glorious dead!',14,0,100,1,0,0,105626,0,'Toryl to Player'),
(102410,3,0,'We all owe Jandvik\'s salvation to one brave $c. Glory to $n! Slayer of Tidemistress Sashj\'tar!',14,0,100,1,0,0,105620,0,'Toryl to Player'),
(102410,4,0,'As sole remaining elder of Jandvik, it is my duty to lead Jandvik into prosperity.',14,0,100,1,0,0,105621,0,'Toryl to Player'),
(102410,5,0,'For this, I proclaim that $n is the new Jarl of Jandvik. All hail $n!',14,0,100,1,0,0,105622,0,'Toryl to Player'),
(102425,0,0,'We need to - Beakbuck, no!',12,0,100,0,0,0,109646,0,'Serena Windfeather to Player'),
(102425,1,0,'Ignore him. I need you to find Lothrius. We were separated in the attack- I think he is still holding out at the Athenaeum.',12,0,100,2,0,0,109650,0,'Serena Windfeather to Player'),
