(103437,4,0,'Aye, let\'s get him the key... but be on your guard. This place is crawling with demons.',12,0,100,0,0,0,105917,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),
(103437,5,0,'Don\'t worry, I\'ll go easy on ye!',12,0,100,0,0,0,106069,0,'Angus Stormbrew'),
(103437,6,0,'Ye wanna fight, eh? I\'ll give ye a fight!',12,0,100,0,0,0,106064,0,'Angus Stormbrew'),
(103437,7,0,'Now, THAT\'S a face worth punching!',12,0,100,0,0,0,106068,0,'Angus Stormbrew'),
(103437,8,0,'Who needs an axe when ye\'ve got fists o\' steel!',12,0,100,0,0,0,106065,0,'Angus Stormbrew'),
(103437,9,0,'Och! This one fell off the ugly tree an\' hit my fists on the way down!',12,0,100,0,0,0,106066,0,'Angus Stormbrew'),
(103437,10,0,'Look! That\'s Brambley\'s helm, I\'d recognize it anywhere!',12,0,100,0,0,0,105919,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),
(103437,11,0,'Brambley! No... no it canna\' be true!',12,0,100,0,0,0,105918,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),
(103437,12,0,'Those demons musta\' ate ol\' Brambley... look at him! He\'s just bones, now!',12,0,100,18,0,0,105920,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),
(103437,13,0,'Curses upon ye, demons! CURSES UPON YE!',12,0,100,20,0,0,105924,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),
(103437,14,0,'Don\'t worry Brambley, I\'ll carry yer wee head to safety!',12,0,100,381,0,0,106438,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),
(103437,15,0,'Here lies his mighty arm that defended the realm in so many battles!',12,0,100,381,0,0,106442,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),
(103437,16,0,'I\'ll take ye home Brambley! Piece by piece, I swear it!',12,0,100,381,0,0,106445,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),
(103437,17,0,'Och, looks like the demons chewed on this one. Aye, it\'s still moist...',12,0,100,381,0,0,106446,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),
(103437,18,0,'Good eye! That\'s his alright... I\'d know it a mile away!',12,0,100,381,0,0,106444,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),
(103437,19,0,'It\'s Brambley\'s Dagger! We\'ll take it home an\' bury it with the rest o\' him.',12,0,100,381,0,0,106447,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),
(103437,20,0,'I can still hear Brambley\'s voice in my head, tellin\' me to stay alive.',12,0,100,0,0,0,106514,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),
(103437,21,0,'I will laddy! I\'ll stay alive for the both of us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,106515,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),
(103453,0,0,'The curs will bring themselves to us. We will blunt their rage and feast on their flesh!',12,0,100,0,0,0,106365,0,'Отрекшийся - ректор to Отрекшийся-обманщик'),
(103458,0,0,'Si une bête sauvage flaire votre peur, c’en est fini de vous. Ne montrez jamais votre peur. Ni vos saucisses, d’ailleurs. Si elle flaire une saucisse dans votre poche, c’en est fini d’une de vos jambes.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,0,'Belluaire Tagh to Player'),
(103458,3,0,'You gotta lock their gaze. That\'s the secret to a good taming!',12,0,100,5,0,0,106357,0,'Beastmaster Tagh to Player'),
(103484,1,0,'Ну что, пора собирать диск?',12,0,100,0,0,0,106439,0,''),
(103484,2,0,'ТЬФУ! Вот только не говори, что нам опять какой-то детали не хватает!',12,0,100,0,0,0,106443,0,''),
(103484,3,0,'Так, вот эта деталь идет сюда...',12,0,100,0,0,0,106440,0,''),
