(110533,0,0,'Ah, Jergosh, at last! Bring me the Book!',14,0,100,0,0,66424,117564,0,'Гул\'дан to Player'),
(110533,1,0,'You have both done well to acquire these artifacts. Your positions in the Shadow Council are all but assured.',12,0,100,1,0,66425,117565,0,'Гул\'дан to Player'),
(110533,2,0,'With the Book of Medivh, the Eye of Dalaran, and the Scepter of Sargeras, we will rip open the gates to all the demon worlds! We will bring the full power of the Legion to bear on this pitiful planet.',14,0,100,1,0,66426,117566,0,'Гул\'дан to Player'),
(110533,3,0,'I will go through the portal and act as a stabilizing anchor on Argus. You must focus the ritual energy through the scepter, widening the breach and creating a myriad of portals.',14,0,100,1,0,66427,117567,0,'Гул\'дан to Player'),
(110533,4,0,'<grim chuckle>Ahh, I only need ONE of you for the ritual. \"Discuss\" the matter quickly, and be ready...',14,0,100,1,0,66429,117576,0,'Гул\'дан to Player'),
(110538,0,0,'We must learn why the old arcan\'dor failed. Its shattered bones may have the answers.',12,0,100,0,0,66383,118555,0,'Valewalker Farodin to Player'),
(110538,3,0,'Нужно понять, почему погиб прежний аркан\'дор. Ответ может крыться в его останках.',12,0,100,0,0,66383,118555,0,'Странник дола Фародин to Player'),
(110548,0,0,'Congratulations on your \"promotion,\" Jergosh. Now let us begin. Take up the scepter... and be careful! This power can tear worlds asunder.',12,0,100,0,0,66431,117590,0,'Image of Gul\'dan to Phantomflame Infernal'),
